(100, 'francais6.webp', ' Les verbes irréguliers', 'Les_verbes_irréguliers', ' Les verbes irréguliers\r\n\r\nfrançais', ' Les verbes irréguliers\r\n\r\n', ' Les verbes irréguliers\r\n\r\n', '', 'verbes-irregulieres.pdf', 'Apprendre le français, تعلم الفرنسية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-03-10 19:30:21', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', '1st Year of Middle School', 'all', 8, 75),
(103, 'francais10.webp', ' Les compléments circonstanciels', 'Les_compléments_circonstanciels', 'Un Complément Circonstanciel précise les circonstances dans lesquelles se déroule l’action exprimée par le verbe lieu de l\'action, durée, manière ..', 'Un Complément Circonstanciel précise les circonstances dans lesquelles se déroule l’action exprimée par le verbe lieu de l\'action, durée, manière ..', 'Un Complément Circonstanciel précise les circonstances dans lesquelles se déroule l’action exprimée par le verbe lieu de l\'action, durée, manière ..', '', 'Les-complements-circonstanciels.pdf', 'Apprendre le français, تعلم الفرنسية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-03-10 19:30:10', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', '1st Year of Middle School', 'all', 8, 75),
(104, 'francais11.webp', ' Les temps du passé (temps du récit)', 'Les_temps_du_passé_temps_du_récit', 'Les enfants sont en vacances. C’est samedi, je décide de les emmener à la plage. Je prépare les sandwichs, les boissons et les bouteilles d’eau. Je les range dans une glacière.', 'Les enfants sont en vacances. C’est samedi, je décide de les emmener à la plage. Je prépare les sandwichs, les boissons et les bouteilles d’eau. Je les range dans une glacière.', 'Les enfants sont en vacances. C’est samedi, je décide de les emmener à la plage. Je prépare les sandwichs, les boissons et les bouteilles d’eau. Je les range dans une glacière.', '', '', 'Apprendre le français, تعلم الفرنسية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-03-10 19:30:04', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', '1st Year of Middle School', 'all', 8, 75),
(105, 'english2.webp', 'Oh, the Places You\'ll Go!', 'Oh_the_Places_Youll_Go', 'Explore the whimsical world of \'Oh, the Places You\'ll Go!\' by Dr. Seuss, a timeless tale of adventure and resilience for all ages', 'Explore the whimsical world of \'Oh, the Places You\'ll Go!\' by Dr. Seuss, a timeless tale of adventure and resilience for all ages', 'english', '', 'oh-the-places-youll-go-by-dr-seuss.pdf', 'Learn English, الانجليزية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-01-03 16:19:46', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(106, 'english3.webp', 'Wacky Wednesday', 'Wacky_Wednesday', '', 'Step into the wacky and wonderful world of \'Wacky Wednesday\' by Dr. Seuss, a delightful and imaginative picture book that celebrates the joy of silliness and unexpected surprises.', 'english', '', 'Wacky_Wednesday_-_Dr_Seuss.pdf', 'Learn English, الانجليزية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-01-03 16:19:46', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(107, 'english4.webp', 'On Beyond Zebra by Dr. Seuss.pdf', 'On_Beyond_Zebra_by_Dr_Seuss_pdf', 'Embark on a whimsical journey \'On Beyond Zebra\' by Dr. Seuss, a charming and imaginative book that invites readers to explore the world beyond the alphabet with delightful creatures and new, imaginary letters', 'Embark on a whimsical journey \'On Beyond Zebra\' by Dr. Seuss, a charming and imaginative book that invites readers to explore the world beyond the alphabet with delightful creatures and new, imaginary letters', 'Dr. Seuss, On Beyond Zebra by ', '', 'On Beyond Zebra by Dr. Seuss.pdf', 'Learn English, قصص و روايات, الانجليزية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-03-09 19:22:37', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(108, 'english5.webp', 'The Lorax', 'The_Lorax', 'Experience the environmental fable \'The Lorax\' by Dr. Seuss, a timeless and thought-provoking story that champions environmental conservation and the importance of protecting nature\'s beauty and resources', 'Experience the environmental fable \'The Lorax\' by Dr. Seuss, a timeless and thought-provoking story that champions environmental conservation and the importance of protecting nature\'s beauty and resources', 'Dr. Seuss;The Lorax', '', 'H3146_The Lorax_Storybook.pdf', 'Learn English, قصص و روايات, الانجليزية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-01-03 16:19:46', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(109, 'english6.webp', 'Dr.-Seuss-The-Cat-in-the-Hat-Random-House-1957.pdf', 'Dr_Seuss_The_Catin_the_Hat_Random_House_1957_pdf', 'Enter the whimsical world of \'The Cat in the Hat\' by Dr. Seuss, a timeless and playful tale that sparks the imagination and brings joy to readers of all ages', 'Enter the whimsical world of \'The Cat in the Hat\' by Dr. Seuss, a timeless and playful tale that sparks the imagination and brings joy to readers of all ages', 'The Cat in the Hat\'', '', 'Dr.-Seuss-The-Cat-in-the-Hat-Random-House-1957.pdf', 'Learn English, قصص و روايات, الانجليزية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-03-09 19:22:22', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(110, 'english7.webp', 'The Cat in the Hat Comes Back', 'The_Cat_in_the_Hat_Comes_Back', 'Dive into the delightful sequel \'The Cat in the Hat Comes Back\' by Dr. Seuss, a charming and mischievous story that continues the adventures of the beloved Cat in the Hat with playful rhymes and whimsical illustrations.', 'Dive into the delightful sequel \'The Cat in the Hat Comes Back\' by Dr. Seuss, a charming and mischievous story that continues the adventures of the beloved Cat in the Hat with playful rhymes and whimsical illustrations.', 'The Cat in the Hat Comes Back', '', 'books-library.online-01251716Ts9P9.pdf', 'Learn English, قصص و روايات, الانجليزية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-01-03 16:19:46', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(111, 'english8.webp', 'oobleck', 'oobleck', 'Experience the magical mischief of \'Bartholomew and the Oobleck\' by Dr. Seuss, a whimsical and enchanting tale that follows Bartholomew as he deals with the consequences of a king\'s unusual request for oobleck, a sticky green substance that causes chaos in the kingdom', 'Experience the magical mischief of \'Bartholomew and the Oobleck\' by Dr. Seuss, a whimsical and enchanting tale that follows Bartholomew as he deals with the consequences of a king\'s unusual request for oobleck, a sticky green substance that causes chaos in the kingdom', 'english', '', '1949_Bartholomew_And_The_Oobleck_Dr_Seuss.pdf', 'Learn English, قصص و روايات, الانجليزية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-01-03 11:30:20', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(112, 'english9.webp', 'Mr. Brown Can Moo! Can You? - Newton International School', 'Mr_Brown_Can_Moo_Can_You_Newton_International_School', 'Explore the world of sounds with Mr. Brown in this engaging children\'s book. The title, \"Mr. Brown Can Moo! Can You?\" invites young readers to join in the fun and discover the joy of interactive storytelling and imaginative play.\"', 'Explore the world of sounds with Mr. Brown in this engaging children\'s book. The title, \"Mr. Brown Can Moo! Can You?\" invites young readers to join in the fun and discover the joy of interactive storytelling and imaginative play.\"', 'english', '', 'Mr.-Brown-Can-Moo-Can-You-by-Dr.-Seuss-z-lib.org_.cbr_.pdf', 'Learn English, قصص و روايات, الانجليزية', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-03-09 19:21:46', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(114, 'religion1.webp', 'The World\'s Religions', 'The_Worlds_Religions', '\"The World\'s Religions\" by Huston Smith is a comprehensive exploration of major religious traditions, offering insight into the beliefs, practices, and histories of Hinduism, Buddhism, Confucianism, Taoism, Islam, Judaism, and Christianity. Smith\'s engaging approach fosters interfaith understanding and invites readers to appreciate the beauty and complexity of diverse spiritual paths.', '\"The World\'s Religions\" by Huston Smith is a comprehensive exploration of major religious traditions, offering insight into the beliefs, practices, and histories of Hinduism, Buddhism, Confucianism, Taoism, Islam, Judaism, and Christianity. Smith\'s engaging approach fosters interfaith understanding and invites readers to appreciate the beauty and complexity of diverse spiritual paths.', 'The World\'s Religions', '', 'The-Worlds-Religions-Our-Great-Wisdom-Traditions-by-Huston-Smith-z-lib.org.pdf', 'أديان وفلسفات,فلسفة', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-01-03 16:19:46', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Post-Baccalaureate', 'all', 8, 75);
INSERT INTO `books` (`books_id`, `Myimage`, `title`, `slug`, `Mysubject`, `Mydescription`, `keywords`, `Author`, `autre`, `the_type`, `dir`, `language`, `visibility_status`, `updated_at`, `created_at`, `educational_level`, `gender`, `min_age`, `max_age`) VALUES
(115, 'religion2.webp', '\"The Essential Rumi\" translated by Coleman Barks pdf', 'The_Essential_Rumi_translated_by_Coleman_Barks_pdf', '\"The Essential Rumi\" by Coleman Barks is a collection of Rumi\'s poetry translated into English. The book offers a selection of Rumi\'s most profound and inspiring poems, capturing the essence of Sufi mysticism and the universal themes of love, spirituality, and inner transformation. Barks\' translations beautifully convey the timeless wisdom and lyrical beauty of Rumi\'s poetry, making it accessible to a wide audience.', '\"The Essential Rumi\" by Coleman Barks is a collection of Rumi\'s poetry translated into English. The book offers a selection of Rumi\'s most profound and inspiring poems, capturing the essence of Sufi mysticism and the universal themes of love, spirituality, and inner transformation. Barks\' translations beautifully convey the timeless wisdom and lyrical beauty of Rumi\'s poetry, making it accessible to a wide audience.', '\"The Essential Rumi\" translated by Coleman Barks pdf', '', 'coleman-barks-the-essential-rumi.pdf', 'أديان وفلسفات,فلسفة', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-01-03 16:19:46', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Post-Baccalaureate', 'all', 8, 75),
(116, 'religion3.webp', '\"The Bhagavad Gita.\" translated by Eknath Easwaran pdf', 'The_Bhagavad_Gita_translated_by_Eknath_Easwaran_pdf', '\"The Bhagavad Gita\" translated by Eknath Easwaran presents a profound and accessible interpretation of the ancient Indian scripture. Easwaran\'s translation captures the timeless wisdom and spiritual insights of the Gita, offering readers a practical guide to life, self-realization, and the paths of devotion, action, and knowledge. The book provides valuable commentary and practical teachings that resonate with readers from diverse backgrounds, making it a cherished resource for spiritual seekers and scholars alike.', '\"The Bhagavad Gita\" translated by Eknath Easwaran presents a profound and accessible interpretation of the ancient Indian scripture. Easwaran\'s translation captures the timeless wisdom and spiritual insights of the Gita, offering readers a practical guide to life, self-realization, and the paths of devotion, action, and knowledge. The book provides valuable commentary and practical teachings that resonate with readers from diverse backgrounds, making it a cherished resource for spiritual seekers and scholars alike.', 'The Bhagavad Gita', '', 'The Bhagavad Gita.pdf', 'أديان وفلسفات,فلسفة', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-01-03 16:19:46', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Post-Baccalaureate', 'all', 8, 75),
(117, 'religion4.webp', 'Muhammad Abdel Haleem | Understanding the Qur\'an', 'Muhammad_Abdel_Haleem_Understanding_the_Quran', '\"Understanding the Qur\'an\" by Muhammad Abdel Haleem offers a comprehensive and accessible guide to the teachings and wisdom of the Islamic holy book. Haleem\'s insightful commentary and clear explanations provide readers with a deeper understanding of the Qur\'an\'s profound spiritual and moral messages. The book serves as an invaluable resource for both Muslims and non-Muslims seeking to explore the timeless wisdom and ethical principles found within the Qur\'an.', '\"Understanding the Qur\'an\" by Muhammad Abdel Haleem offers a comprehensive and accessible guide to the teachings and wisdom of the Islamic holy book. Haleem\'s insightful commentary and clear explanations provide readers with a deeper understanding of the Qur\'an\'s profound spiritual and moral messages. The book serves as an invaluable resource for both Muslims and non-Muslims seeking to explore the timeless wisdom and ethical principles found within the Qur\'an.', 'Muslims+religion', '', 'Abdel-Haleem-Understanding-the-Quran.pdf', 'أديان وفلسفات,فلسفة', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-03-10 19:29:37', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 14, 75),
(118, 'religion6.webp', 'Stephen Mitchell translation of the Tao Te Ching - CDN', 'Stephen_Mitchell_translation_of_the_Tao_Te_Ching_CDN', '\"The Tao Te Ching,\" translated by Stephen Mitchell, offers a poetic and insightful interpretation of the ancient Chinese text attributed to Lao Tzu. Mitchell\'s translation captures the timeless wisdom and philosophical depth of the Tao Te Ching, providing readers with a profound exploration of Taoist principles and the nature of existence. The book\'s accessible language and universal themes make it a beloved resource for those seeking guidance on living in harmony with the natural flow of life and embracing the principles of balance, simplicity, and humility.', '\"The Tao Te Ching,\" translated by Stephen Mitchell, offers a poetic and insightful interpretation of the ancient Chinese text attributed to Lao Tzu. Mitchell\'s translation captures the timeless wisdom and philosophical depth of the Tao Te Ching, providing readers with a profound exploration of Taoist principles and the nature of existence. The book\'s accessible language and universal themes make it a beloved resource for those seeking guidance on living in harmony with the natural flow of life and embracing the principles of balance, simplicity, and humility.', 'The Tao Te Ching', '', '-Perennial-Classics-Lao-Tzu-Stephen-Mitchell---Tao-Te-Ching_-A-New-English-Version-Harper-Perennial-Modern-Classics-2006-2-4--pDMw9.pdf', 'أديان وفلسفات,فلسفة', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-03-09 19:21:25', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(119, 'religion7.webp', 'Book of Mormon', 'Book_of_Mormon', 'The \"Book of Mormon\" is a sacred text of the Latter-day Saint movement, which includes the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints and other related denominations. It is regarded as a companion scripture to the Bible and is believed to contain an account of ancient prophets and their interactions with God in the Americas. The book recounts religious and historical narratives, including the ministry of Jesus Christ among the ancient inhabitants of the American continent. It is considered a foundational text for the faith and teachings of the Latter-day Saint tradition.', 'The \"Book of Mormon\" is a sacred text of the Latter-day Saint movement, which includes the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints and other related denominations. It is regarded as a companion scripture to the Bible and is believed to contain an account of ancient prophets and their interactions with God in the Americas. The book recounts religious and historical narratives, including the ministry of Jesus Christ among the ancient inhabitants of the American continent. It is considered a foundational text for the faith and teachings of the Latter-day Saint tradition.', 'Book of Mormon', '', 'Book of Mormon.pdf', 'أديان وفلسفات,فلسفة', 'ltr', '', 'public', '2025-01-03 16:19:46', '2024-08-20 23:00:00', 'Post-Baccalaureate', 'all', 15, 75),
